WEBVTT

00:02:29.395 --> 00:02:30.545
that set point.

00:02:31.112 --> 00:02:33.976
But what we now know,
is that for a number of diseases,

00:02:34.000 --> 00:02:36.385
there are defects in the system,

00:02:36.409 --> 00:02:38.910
where the body can't prune back
extra blood vessels,

00:02:38.934 --> 00:02:42.534
or can't grow enough new ones
in the right place at the right time.

00:02:42.884 --> 00:02:46.709
And in these situations,
angiogenesis is out of balance.

00:02:47.193 --> 00:02:49.121
And when angiogenesis is out of balance,

00:02:49.145 --> 00:02:50.899
a myriad of diseases result.

00:02:51.304 --> 00:02:54.976
For example, insufficient angiogenesis --
not enough blood vessels --

00:02:55.000 --> 00:02:57.976
leads to wounds
that don't heal, heart attacks,

00:02:58.000 --> 00:03:00.615
legs without circulation,
death from stroke,